Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains MATLAB source code developed by Alexandre
Matov for computing speckle modulation in fluorescent speckle
microscopy image data. The code depends on a MATLAB toolbox that is
NOT included in this repository -- see DEPENDENCIES.md.

